  "limitations": [
    "The eight inspected sheets show 36 static action poses and four selection portraits. The four stances and opposite-facing draw checks are supported by the executed reports; they are not claimed to appear in these eight visual sheets.",
    "The reports record 80 draw checks, zero missing assets and zero aliased actions. This review binds those reports and the exact inspected files by SHA256; it does not rerun or expand the tests.",
    "Production Canvas2D under Node/native Skia is the execution surface. Browser, DOM, controls, input, audio, service-worker behavior and physical devices remain not executed here.",
    "Static sheets do not establish animation timing, transitions, interpolation, collision accuracy or a complete frame-by-frame animation.",
    "Café is an illustrated source adaptation; the three Murder Drones variants are original Encore creations. No canonical costume, episode-by-episode fidelity or official 1:1 anatomy certification is made.",
    "The three-lobe hand treatment in the crossover set is an original harmonization choice. Fine digit counts are documented in native alpha reviews; masked or folded fingers are not fully countable from reduced Canvas previews.",
    "The small arcs, ground shadows and action indicators visible in the sheets belong to the renderer presentation; the native PNG transparency was evaluated separately.",
    "No native asset, runtime module, report or rendered sheet was modified during this inspection."
  ],
